Package: flowcam
Type: Package
Title: Access USGS Stream Gage Camera Images via the NIMS API
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("First", "Last", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "you@example.com")
Description: Provides functions to query camera metadata, list image filenames,
    build image URLs, and download images from the U.S. Geological Survey
    National Imagery Management System (NIMS) API
    <https://api.waterdata.usgs.gov/nims/v0>. Integrates with the
    'dataRetrieval' package to enrich camera records with NWIS site metadata.
    Authentication via the API_USGS_PAT environment variable follows the same
    convention used by 'dataRetrieval'.
